{"log_id":"20261106233044C6E3FDF2102D668DFD4F","code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7482735901034957848","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/0df080ffb3ec4f32c1ef47344a9af3e3~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799163046&x-signature=6%2BGrLBy9pKOY6GeBesXkVEiF2yo%3D","duration":3228,"title":"人不如故","video_desc":"沈傅辰上辈子选择和周诗语在一起追梦，却屡屡碰壁，在重压之下和周诗语由爱人变怨侣，在一次争吵中车祸重生。这辈子沈傅辰选择和上辈子完全迥异的道路，抛下周诗语和曾经的音乐梦想，和张雅然出国深造，成为事业有成的金融人士。得知周诗语放下了上辈子的感情后大受打击，意识到放不下的人从来是自己，后期追妻火葬场却失败收场。","series_id":"7482660207336623166","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233044C6E3FDF2102D668DFD4F\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7482660207336623166\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.9133634567260742,\\\"collect\\\":0.027585281059145927,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.06052828207612038,\\\"like\\\":0.04401865601539612,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.07591621577739716,\\\"finish\\\":0.019419347867369652,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.716064989566803}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7482660207336623166","play_cnt":14990,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"广州林阳文化传媒有限公司","sub_title":"成长·女性成长","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":30,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5010,\"name\":\"成长\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5010&categoryName=成长&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5045,\"name\":\"女性成长\",\"sche